### POST Crear monumento
POST http://localhost:8080/monument
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "countryCode": "234gh",
  "countryName": "Spain",
  "cityName": "Seville",
  "latitude": 123.123,
  "length": 567.567,
  "monumentName": "Giralda",
  "monumentDescription": "a simple tower",
  "imageURL": "https://mymodernmet.com/wp/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Giralda-1.jpg"
}

### GET obtener todos los productos
GET http://localhost:8080/monument

### GET obtener producto id 1
GET http://localhost:8080/monument/1

### PUT Modificar producto
PUT http://localhost:8080/monument/1
Content-Type: application/json

